[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3691962227","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/114339#issuecomment-3691962227","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/114339","id":3691962227,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7cDt9z","user":{"login":"ej-sanmartin","id":29460583,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI5NDYwNTgz","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/29460583?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ej-sanmartin","html_url":"https://github.com/ej-sanmartin","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ej-sanmartin/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ej-sanmartin/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ej-sanmartin/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ej-sanmartin/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ej-sanmartin/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ej-sanmartin/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ej-sanmartin/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ej-sanmartin/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ej-sanmartin/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-12-26T02:44:50Z","updated_at":"2025-12-26T02:44:50Z","body":"Sounds like a clear synchronization issue.\n\nIn `scene/gui/tree.cpp:3253`:\n\n```cpp\nrange_click_timer->set_wait_time(0.6);\n```\n\nInitting this `600 ms` timer seems entirely too long and would explain issues with fast clicks like this, if this isn't handled carefully.\n\nEarlier in the method `Tree::propogate_mouse_event()`, while the timer is running, clicks on different items are rejected at line 3090-3092, which can block legitimate user interactions.\n\n```cpp\nif (range_click_timer->get_time_left() > 0 && p_item != range_item_last) {\n    return -1;\n}\n```\n\n---\n\nWe should be more event driven here instead of solely relying on the temporal-bounded state of `Tree::propogate_mouse_event()`.\n\nRapidly clicking two different Tree items activates the wrong item because the timer-based repetition logic queries the current cursor position instead of using the original click position. Store the click position when the timer starts and use it to preserve the user's original intent. Also allow clicking other items while the timer runs instead of blocking them.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3691962227/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3693909237","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/114339#issuecomment-3693909237","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/114339","id":3693909237,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7cLJT1","user":{"login":"KoBeWi","id":2223172,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyMjMxNzI=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2223172?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi","html_url":"https://github.com/KoBeWi","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-12-27T11:09:00Z","updated_at":"2025-12-27T11:09:00Z","body":"I tried testing it again and can't reproduce it anymore 💀 (at least not right now. I wonder if it depends on something??)","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3693909237/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3694174248","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/114339#issuecomment-3694174248","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/114339","id":3694174248,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7cMKAo","user":{"login":"ej-sanmartin","id":29460583,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI5NDYwNTgz","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/29460583?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ej-sanmartin","html_url":"https://github.com/ej-sanmartin","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ej-sanmartin/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ej-sanmartin/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ej-sanmartin/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ej-sanmartin/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ej-sanmartin/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ej-sanmartin/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ej-sanmartin/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ej-sanmartin/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ej-sanmartin/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-12-27T19:26:52Z","updated_at":"2025-12-27T19:28:28Z","body":"I also had trouble reproducing the original issue RIP though it being present and then not all of a sudden indicates there are some edge cases original implementation is not covering.\n\n`range_click_timer` that gets set during this interaction *should* be cleared if we click on another item, as-is it does silently block if we click Item B but a timer set by Item A is still running. I'll quickly adjust PR since that's important.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3694174248/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]